  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 16 ÷ 4 + 20 × 82 − 14 = 148\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) = and ×\n\n16 ÷ 4 + 20 × 82 − 14 = 148 ⇒ 16 ÷ 4 + 20 = 82 − 14 × 148\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ + 20 = 82 − __**14 **____**× 148**__\n\n⇒ __**4 + 20**__ = __**82 − 2072**__\n\n⇒ 24 ≠ -1990 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) + and − \n\n16 ÷ 4 + 20 × 82 − 14 = 148 ⇒ 16 ÷ 4 - 20 × 82 + 14 = 148\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ - 20 × 82 + 14 = 148\n\n⇒ 4 - __**20 × 82**__ + 14 = 148\n\n⇒ __**4 + 14**__ - 1640 = 148\n\n⇒ __18** - 1640**__ = 148\n\n⇒ -1622 ≠ 148 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) + and ×\n\n16 ÷ 4 + 20 × 82 − 14 = 148 ⇒ 16 ÷ 4 × 20 + 82 − 14 = 148\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ × 20 + 82 − 14 = 148\n\n⇒ __**4 ×**____** 20**__ + 82 − 14 = 148\n\n⇒ __**8**____**0 + 82**__ − 14 = 148\n\n⇒ **__16__**__2** − 14**__ = 148\n\n⇒ 148 = 148 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) + and =\n\n16 ÷ 4 + 20 × 82 − 14 = 148 ⇒ 16 ÷ 4 = 20 × 82 − 14 + 148\n\n⇒ __**16 ÷ 4**__ = __**20 × 82**__ − 14 + 148\n\n⇒ 4 = __**1640 + 148**__ − 14\n\n⇒ 4 = __1788** − 14**__\n\n⇒ 4 ≠ 1774 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
